## Proposed Changes

### 1. Backend — New Database Schema & Models

#### [NEW] `app/models/student.py`
SQLAlchemy model: `students` table — id, name, roll_no, email, phone, college_id (FK), department, semester, profile_photo_path, is_enrolled, enrollment_status, created_at

#### [NEW] `app/models/teacher.py`
SQLAlchemy model: `teachers` table — id, name, email, password_hash, institution, is_admin, created_at

#### [NEW] `app/models/class_model.py`
SQLAlchemy model: `classes` table — id, subject_name, subject_code, teacher_id (FK), room_number, schedule (JSON), min_attendance_pct, late_threshold_minutes

#### [NEW] `app/models/enrollment.py`
SQLAlchemy model: `enrollments` table — id, student_id (FK), class_id (FK), enrolled_at, status

#### [NEW] `app/models/face_descriptor.py`
SQLAlchemy model: `face_descriptors` table — id, student_id (FK), embedding (JSON array 512-d), quality_score, created_at

#### [MODIFY] `app/models/attendance.py`
Add: class_id (FK), status (present/absent/late), confidence_score, is_manual_override, time_marked fields

#### [NEW] `app/models/college.py`
SQLAlchemy model: `colleges` table — id, name, api_key_hash, permissions (JSON), webhook_url, ip_whitelist

#### [NEW] `app/models/notification.py`
SQLAlchemy model: `notifications` table — id, user_id, type, message, is_read, created_at

---

### 2. Backend — New API Routers

#### [NEW] `app/api/auth.py`
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` — returns JWT (teacher + student)
- `POST /api/v1/auth/student-login` — student login by roll_no + password
- `POST /api/v1/auth/college-token` — API key → JWT for partner college
- `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh`
- JWT middleware for all protected routes

#### [NEW] `app/api/classes.py`
- `GET/POST /api/v1/classes` — list/create
- `GET/PUT/DELETE /api/v1/classes/:id`
- `POST /api/v1/classes/:id/students` — assign students
- `GET /api/v1/classes/:id/students`

#### [NEW] `app/api/students.py`
- `GET/POST /api/v1/students` — list/create
- `GET/PUT/DELETE /api/v1/students/:id`
- `POST /api/v1/students/bulk-import` — CSV upload
- `GET /api/v1/students/:id/attendance` — history

#### [MODIFY] `app/api/register.py`
- Add: quality check (blur detection, face angle), enrollment confidence score, multi-photo enrollment with quality scoring

#### [MODIFY] `app/api/recognize.py`
- Add: class_id param, mark attendance per-class, WebSocket broadcast on recognition

#### [NEW] `app/api/attendance.py` (replace stub)
- `GET /api/v1/attendance` — filter by class/date/student
- `PUT /api/v1/attendance/:id` — manual override
- `GET /api/v1/attendance/reports` — aggregated stats
- `POST /api/v1/attendance/export` — PDF/Excel

#### [NEW] `app/api/integrate.py`
- `POST /api/v1/integrate/enroll`
- `GET /api/v1/integrate/students`
- `POST /api/v1/integrate/attendance`
- `GET /api/v1/integrate/attendance/:id`

#### [NEW] `app/api/websocket.py`
- `WS /ws/attendance/:session_id` — real-time recognition events

---

### 3. Backend — Services Updates

#### [MODIFY] `app/services/face_service.py`
- Replace YOLOv8 (general detection) with **MediaPipe Face Detection** (faster, face-specific, no 6MB YOLO needed for face-only task. YOLOv8 stays as optional fallback)
- Add image quality checks: blur (Laplacian variance), brightness, face angle estimation

#### [MODIFY] `app/services/embedding_service.py`
- Add: cosine similarity instead of euclidean for matching
- Add: average embedding from multiple enrollment photos

#### [NEW] `app/services/auth_service.py`
- JWT creation/validation (python-jose)
- bcrypt password hashing (passlib)
- API key generation (secrets)

#### [NEW] `app/services/report_service.py`
- PDF generation (reportlab or fpdf2)
- Excel export (openpyxl)
- Attendance stats computation

#### [NEW] `app/services/notification_service.py`
- Email via SMTP (smtplib / fastapi-mail)
- In-app notification creation

---

