## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Backend: start server
cd Facial-Attendance-System--main
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload

# Visit FastAPI docs
open http://localhost:8000/docs

# Frontend: start dev server
cd frontend && npm run dev
open http://localhost:5173
```

### Manual Verification Checklist
1. Login as teacher → dashboard loads with real class data
2. Create a new class → appears in list
3. Add student → face enrollment (upload + webcam modes)
4. Start attendance → webcam activates, face boxes appear, name labels shown
5. Session end → summary popup, attendance logged to DB
6. Login as student → dashboard shows attendance %
7. Student self-enrollment → 8-angle capture, quality check, submission
8. Reports → charts render, PDF exports correctly
9. Settings → API key generated for partner college
10. Integration API → POST to `/api/v1/integrate/enroll` with API key
